    "title": "Jalen Brunson says he's 'fully cleared' for Knicks training camp after offseason wrist surgery - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Dan Devine via Yahoo Sports, ,\n1 days ago Three days before the New York Knicks are scheduled to hold their annual media day session to open the 2026-27 season, Jalen Brunson broke some news of his own on Thursday. After undergoing surgery on his left wrist back in July, Brunson has been “fully cleared” to return to the floor in training camp as the Knicks begin to defend their NBA championship. Brunson delivered the good news to a crowd of thousands who turned out to Randall’s Island Park for the Roommates Show Block Party, a live episode of the podcast he co-hosts with Knicks teammate Josh Hart. “As… Read full article",
